  "reference": "Native Hunspell 1.7.5 C API, independently loaded from the official release on each machine. Input grammar based on hunspell(5). 75 published archives checked against their release SHA-256. Three equivalent rule flag encodings; 1–4 piece words, optional and repeated tokens, terminal affixes, positional permissions, local casing and Hungarian syllables.",
